  ogImage={{ src: media('/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/Passoa-Cocktails.png'), width: 500, height: 300, alt: 'Passoa Cocktails title card' }}
>
  <h2>What is Passoa?</h2>
  <p><strong>Passoa is a passion fruit liqueur made in France, with an alcoholic strength of between 14.9% and 20%.</strong></p>
  <p>It was created in 1985 by the Rémy Cointreau group, launched in Europe in 1986 and went worldwide in 1994. <a href="/what-is-passoa/">You can read more about Passoa here.</a></p>

  <aside class="pick" aria-label="Our Passoa pick">
    <span class="pick__label">Our top pick</span>
    <img class="pick__img" src={media('/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/passoa.jpg')} width="199" height="300" alt="Bottle of Passoa passion fruit liqueur" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    <div>
      <p class="pick__name">Passoa</p>
      <p class="pick__why">The passion fruit liqueur behind every recipe on this page.</p>
